    "FOCUS.EXTRACTION.BACK_TO_TRUCK": "(fi) Get back to the truck!",
    "TUTORIAL.TRANSITION_TEXT": "(fi) Good job!",
    "TUTORIAL.MOVEMENT.TEXT": "(fi) Use [move] to move.",
    "TUTORIAL.MOVEMENT.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Move to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.MOVEMENT.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Use [move] on your keyboard until the progress bar is filled!",
    "TUTORIAL.JUMPING.TEXT": "(fi) Press [jump] to jump.",
    "TUTORIAL.JUMPING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Jump to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.JUMPING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Press [jump] to do jumps until the progress bar is filled!",
    "TUTORIAL.SNEAKING.TEXT": "(fi) Press [crouch] to sneak. Monsters are less likely to see you.",
    "TUTORIAL.SNEAKING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Sneak to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.SNEAKING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Hold [crouch] and use [move] until the progess is filled!",
    "TUTORIAL.HIDING.TEXT": "(fi) Use [crouch] to sneak under stuff and hide.",
    "TUTORIAL.HIDING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Hide to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.HIDING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Hold [crouch] and walk in under a prop, stay there until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.SPRINTING.TEXT": "(fi) Hold down [sprint] to sprint. This drains your energy.",
    "TUTORIAL.SPRINTING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Sprint to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.SPRINTING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Hold [sprint] and use [move] to sprint until you filled the progress bar! If the energy runs out, wait for it to regenerate!",
    "TUTORIAL.TUMBLING.TEXT": "(fi) Run and press [tumble] to fall with style. Jumping also helps!",
    "TUTORIAL.TUMBLING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Run, jump and fall to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.TUMBLING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Run with [sprint], jump with [jump] and press [tumble] to throw yourself. Do it until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.GRABBING.TEXT": "(fi) Grab objects using [grab].",
    "TUTORIAL.GRABBING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Carry that thing to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.GRABBING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Press and hold [grab] on an object until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.PUSHING_AND_PULLING.TEXT": "(fi) Use [push] to alter the distance of grabbed objects.",
    "TUTORIAL.PUSHING_AND_PULLING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Alter the distance of a grabbed item!",
    "TUTORIAL.PUSHING_AND_PULLING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Press and hold [grab] on an object and use [push] to alter the distance of the item you grabbed!",
    "TUTORIAL.ROTATING.TEXT": "(fi) Rotate grabbed objects using [grab2].",
    "TUTORIAL.ROTATING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Rotate stuff to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.ROTATING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) While holding an object with [grab], press and hold [grab2] and move your aim to rotate it. Rotate until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.ITEM_TOGGLING.TEXT": "(fi) Grab and press [interact] to toggle items.",
    "TUTORIAL.ITEM_TOGGLING.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Toggle that thing on and off!",
    "TUTORIAL.ITEM_TOGGLING.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Grab the ball with [grab] and toggle it on and off using [interact] until you fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_FILL.TEXT": "(fi) Grab an Item and use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3] to put it in your inventory.",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_FILL.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Fill your entire inventory!",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_FILL.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) While holding an item with [grab], press [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3]. Fill all spots in your inventory to complete the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_EMPTY.TEXT": "(fi) Use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3] to take items out of your inventory.",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_EMPTY.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Empty your entire inventory!",
    "TUTORIAL.INVENTORY_EMPTY.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3] and empty all spots to fill the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.MAP.TEXT": "(fi) Use [map] to view the map. The map is <b><u>IMPORTANT</u></b> for navigation.",
    "TUTORIAL.MAP.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Check the map!",
    "TUTORIAL.MAP.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Hold down [map] and view it until you have filled the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_1.TEXT": "(fi) This is a C.A.R.T. Grab it by the handle.",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_1.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Walk around with the C.A.R.T. a little!",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_1.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Grab the C.A.R.T. by the handle with [grab] and walk around with it until you have filled the progress bar!",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_2.TEXT": "(fi) Fill C.A.R.T.s with valuables. C.A.R.T.s are <b><u>IMPORTANT</u></b> for carrying more stuff.",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_2.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Fill the C.A.R.T. with valuables!",
    "TUTORIAL.CART_HANDLING_2.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Put three items into the C.A.R.T.",
    "TUTORIAL.EXTRACTION_POINTS.TEXT": "(fi) Activate and fill <b><u>EXTRACTION POINTS</u></b> with valuables.",
    "TUTORIAL.EXTRACTION_POINTS.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Extract the valuables!",
    "TUTORIAL.EXTRACTION_POINTS.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) HELLO! FILL THE <b><u>EXTRACTION POINT</u></b> WITH VALUABLES!",
    "TUTORIAL.TRUCK.TEXT": "(fi) Enter the <b><u>TRUCK</u></b> and send a message to your boss in order to leave a level.",
    "TUTORIAL.TRUCK.FOCUS_TEXT": "(fi) Get into the truck and send a message!",
    "TUTORIAL.TRUCK.DUMMY_TEXT": "(fi) Walk into the truck, grab and hold the message area on the truck screen with [grab] to send a message!",
    "TUTORIAL.HEALING.TEXT": "(fi) Share your health with other players by grabbing their necks!",
    "TUTORIAL.REVIVING.TEXT": "(fi) Revive other players by extracting their heads!",
    "TUTORIAL.CHARGING_STATION.TEXT": "(fi) Buy <b><u>POWER CRYSTALS</u></b> for the <b><u>CHARGING STATION</u></b> to recharge and repair your gear!",
    "TUTORIAL.ONLY_ONE_EXTRACTION.TEXT": "(fi) Only one <b><u>EXTRACTION POINT</u></b> can be active at a time, find the current one using your map!",
    "TUTORIAL.CHAT.TEXT": "(fi) Press [chat] to open the chat! It's fun!",
    "TUTORIAL.FINAL_EXTRACTION.TEXT": "(fi) Time to leave, the truck heals you and revives carried player heads!",
    "TUTORIAL.MULTIPLE_EXTRACTIONS.TEXT": "(fi) This level has multiple <b><u>EXTRACTION POINTS</u></b>, you must clear them all to leave!",
    "TUTORIAL.SHOP.TEXT": "(fi) This is the <b><u>SHOP</u></b>, extract items to purchase. No harm lasts here!",
    "TUTORIAL.EXPRESSIONS.TEXT": "(fi) Use [expression1]/[expression2]/[expression3]/[expression4]/[expression5]/[expression6] to make expressions. You can even mix!",
    "TUTORIAL.OVERCHARGE_1.TEXT": "(fi) Grabbing an enemy will now cause overcharge, when full you get blasted.",
    "TUTORIAL.OVERCHARGE_2.TEXT": "(fi) Multiple people will dampen the overcharge effect.",
    "TUTORIAL.HEAD_SPECTATE_1.TEXT": "(fi) While dead your head charges, use that charge to briefly possess your head.",
    "TUTORIAL.HEAD_SPECTATE_2.TEXT": "(fi) While possessing your head, hold [jump] to jump. Hold to jump higher at a greater cost.",
    "TUTORIAL.ENEMY_ELSA.TEXT": "(fi) PET THE DOG!",
    "MOON_UI.SKIP": "(fi) [menu] to skip",
    "TUTORIAL.EXTRACTION_REMINDER.TEXT": "(fi) Fill <b><u>EXTRACTION POINTS</u></b> with valuables.",
